<title>USA: Haven Bancorp Q3 net drops with SAIF charge.</title>
<headline>Haven Bancorp Q3 net drops with SAIF charge.</headline>
<dateline>WOODHAVEN, N.Y. 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>HAVEN BANCORP INC</p>
<p>			  (in thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>				Three Months Ended  Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>					   Sept. 30,	  Sept. 30,</p>
<p>					   1996    1995    1996    1995</p>
<p>	Total Interest Income    27,963  25,317  80,881  70,429</p>
<p>	Total Interest Expense   15,972  14,877  45,539  39,996</p>
<p>Net interest income before</p>
<p>  provision for loan losses    11,991  10,440  35,342  30,433</p>
<p> Provision for loan losses	  700     700   2,475   2,000</p>
<p>Net interest income after</p>
<p>  provision for loan losses    11,291   9,740  32,867  28,433</p>
<p>Total Non-Interest Income</p>
<p>					  2,251   2,076   7,188   5,841</p>
<p>Total Non-Interest Expense</p>
<p>					 14,024   7,903  29,484  23,322</p>
<p>Income (loss) before income</p>
<p>  tax expense (benefit)	   (482)   3,913  10,571  10,952</p>
<p> Income tax expense (benefit)   (559)   1,708   4,610   5,053</p>
<p> Net income				77   2,205   5,961   5,899</p>
<p>Net income per common share  </p>
<p>	  Primary			0.02    0.49    1.35    1.31</p>
<p>	  Fully Diluted		0.02    0.49    1.35    1.31</p>
<p>NOTE: The current third quarter includes a $77,000 SAIF charge.</p>
<p>Excluding special items such as the SAIF charge, an expense reduction resulting from freezing the company's pension benefits and a tax benefit realting to New York State income taxes, third quarter 1996 earning would have been $3.1 million or $0.69 a share.</p>
<p>Excluding these item, net income for the first nine months of would have been $9.5 million or $2.14 a share, the company said.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
